abstract: >
  Ocean alkalinity enhancement (OAE) transport matrix model (TMM). Uses an
  implicit Euler solver with the OCIM2-48L transport matrix to simulate the
  global evolution of dissolved inorganic carbon and total alkalinity in
  response to alkalinity perturbations, with air-sea CO2 exchange.
